:: Backgrounds [widget]
<<widget "backgrounds">>
	<div class="settingsGrid">
		<div class="settingsHeader options">Backgrounds</div>
			<div class="settingsToggleItemWide">
				<span class="green">Dynamic images will change to reflect the current location. These can be replaced in the backgrounds folder, found in the img folder, by replacing the location image with a new one. Make sure to keep the name the same.</span>
				<br><br>
				<span class="gold">Background Type:</span><br>
				<label>Dynamic <<radiovar "$staticimages" "0">><<updatesidebarimg>><</radiovar>></label> |
				<label>Static <<radiovar "$staticimages" "1">><<updatesidebarimg>><</radiovar>></label>
				<br><br>
				<span class="green">Static background images are images that will be displayed at all times when selected. Just enter the static image folder inside backgrounds and replace the number you want to use.</span>
				<br><br>
				<span class="gold">Static Background Options:</span><br>
					<label>Static Background 1 <<radiovar "$static" "1">><<updatesidebarimg>><</radiovar>></label> |
					<label>Static Background 2 <<radiovar "$static" "2">><<updatesidebarimg>><</radiovar>></label> |
